  "findings": {
    "profile_switch_via_updatedInput": "observed - patching subagent_type + model together spawns the target profile; the child hook input reports agent_type jev-gate:worker-fast / jev-gate:worker-frontier and tool_response.resolvedModel is claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 / claude-fable-5-1",
    "permissions_and_tools_preserved": "observed - the rebound worker used Read, Bash, Write and Edit under native acceptEdits permissions; effort.txt was created and README.md edited in the c1-fast and c1-frontier cells",
    "child_effort_haiku": "observed NOT applied - worker-fast declares effort: low, yet the child hook input has no `effort` key at all and `echo CLAUDE_EFFORT=$CLAUDE_EFFORT` in the child shell printed an empty value (cell c1b2-effort, first delegation)",
    "child_effort_fable": "observed applied - worker-frontier declares effort: xhigh; the child hook input carries effort {\"level\":\"xhigh\"} and the child shell printed CLAUDE_EFFORT=xhigh (cell c1b2-effort, second delegation)",
    "root_effort_shape": "observed - root PreToolUse/PostToolUse/Stop carry effort as an OBJECT {\"level\":\"high\"} (root effort, not the child tier); UserPromptSubmit carries no effort key",
    "prompt_id_presence": "observed on UserPromptSubmit, PreToolUse, PostToolUse and Stop, at the root and in children",
    "run_in_background_absent": "confirmed for 2.1.276 - Agent tool_input keys are description/prompt/subagent_type only under CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_BACKGROUND_TASKS=1",
    "env_leakage_caveat": "the first effort cell (c1b-effort, superseded) inherited CLAUDE_EFFORT=xhigh from the launching Claude Code session and therefore reported xhigh for BOTH children; every later cell strips CLAUDE_EFFORT and the other CLAUDE_* session variables before spawning",
    "product_defect_found": "src/hook.ts parseInput accepts `effort` only when typeof === \"string\", but the host sends an object, so HookInput.effort is always dropped and Receipt.root_effort / trace root_effort are null in every run below (see check 2 and 6 traces)"
  },
